00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Looking up from Fisherman's Horizon as Balamb Garden's golden emblem descends from the sky.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:13.000
The Garden's hull slams into the dock. Metal grinds against metal amid sparks and debris.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Water erupts in a massive spray as the Garden settles against the platform.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Aerial view. Trabia Garden lies in a smoking crater, its wreckage amid green hills.
